      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "これでメカボが直せるかもしれない……\r\nよかった……",
        "official_en": "I can’t believe it... I actually might be able to see Mechabo again...",
        "real_en": "Maybe we can repair Mechabo after all... Thank goodness..."
