      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ダイナモ石は、工房近くで見かける\r\n「イプー」を2体倒せば十分な数が集まるはずだ。",
        "official_en": "You can get them off an Ipooh. I usually see them around the forge. Defeating two of them should get you enough.",
        "real_en": "You should be able to get enough dynamo stones by defeating two Ipoohs near the forge."
      },
