        "jp_sha256": "2d4b40e63a2f20bcd49e7ca858018c8ed960c2e37a6624787b3f76294b15c39d",
        "official_en_sha256": "b9744b098dcf40d193152abc59e05b98b63121cf1fb52fbf455bf8b8b3fe55c5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "メカボは設計図もつくらずに\r\n兄さんといじりながら、つくってきたの……。\r\nだから、修理するのは難しいと思う。",
        "official_en": "Well, when my brother and I built Mechabo, we didn’t draft up any blueprints... We pretty much freestyled his design. I think it’d be too tricky to fix him.",
        "real_en": "My older brother and I built Mechabo by tinkering with him as we went, without even making blueprints... That’s why I think repairing him would be difficult."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
