      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "好きでやることだ。\r\n修理するのが難しいと言われたら\r\n黙っていられない。",
        "official_en": "It’ll be a fun side project for me. If somebody says something’s too difficult to fix, I take that as a challenge.",
        "real_en": "I’m doing it because I want to. When someone says something is difficult to repair, I can’t just let it go."
      },
