        "official_en_sha256": "2c2c64bd866306066b29aca227989b1a61d50868142785fc5223bf26d42688c2"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "知ってるも何も……。\r\nすごい人気の鍛冶師なんだけど。\r\nオーダーメイドは数年先まで予約がいっぱいって聞くわ。",
        "official_en": "Yeah, it’d be hard not to in my line of work. He’s one of the most popular blacksmiths around—I hear he’s booked out with custom orders for years to come.",
        "real_en": "Of course I know him... He's a very popular blacksmith. I hear his custom orders are booked years in advance."
